{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-40256","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70194","text":"Forge Semantic IR v1 — MEASURE (pre-freeze memo)"}]},{"id":"blk-40257","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70195","text":"*Status: "},{"id":"spn-70196","marks":["bold"],"text":"MEASURE only — NOT frozen."},{"id":"spn-70197","text":" This is the \"measure before building\" artifact for WRL Phase 2 (freeze Forge Semantic IR v1). It inventories the IR vocabulary the forge lowering has ALREADY grounded, maps the frozen WRL Core 0.1 families onto it, and isolates the open freeze-decisions that need a GPT-5.6 ruling before anything is frozen.*"}]},{"id":"blk-40258","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70198","text":"Per the WRL architectural rule: WRL Core → "},{"id":"spn-70199","marks":["bold"],"text":"Forge Semantic IR"},{"id":"spn-70200","text":" → TRVM facts/films/reductions. WRL surface text never lowers directly to interaction-calculus text. IR v1 is that middle layer. This memo measures what it must contain."}]},{"id":"blk-40259","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70201","text":"1. What is already grounded (the de-facto IR)"}]},{"id":"blk-40260","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-70202","text":"The forge lowering ("},{"id":"spn-70203","marks":["code"],"text":"fixture.py"},{"id":"spn-70204","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-70205","marks":["code"],"text":"compiler.py"},{"id":"spn-70206","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-70207","marks":["code"],"text":"lower_e2a.py"},{"id":"spn-70208","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-70209","marks":["code"],"text":"admit_ic.py"},{"id":"spn-70210","text":" → IC) already consumes a structured graph description and a per-epoch input. That structure IS a proto-IR. Measured surface:"}]},{"id":"blk-40261","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-70211","text":"1.1 Node kinds (5, closed today)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-40263","spans":[{"id":"spn-70212","text":"Kind"}]},{"id":"blk-40264","spans":[{"id":"spn-70213","text":"Params"}]},{"id"